HST Office: the Styles hover preview keeps the paragraphs' direct formatting.

Setting ParaStyleName goes through SwDoc::SetTextFormatColl with bReset, which clears the hard
paragraph attributes (alignment, indents, spacing, background, numbering, character attributes set
on the paragraph). The preview put back only the style name, and with undo locked the loss was
silent. Before the preview every paragraph's DIRECT_VALUE properties are read (XPropertyState);
after the style is put back, properties the preview made direct return to the style's value and the
saved ones are set again, numbering first, so the paragraph is as it was.

- svx/source/tbxctrls/StylesPreviewWindow.cxx.

